*Legend: [{Button}] [Input] [Link] [>Dropdown] [Avatar] [Icon]*

## Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Search Input | Input | Filters cycles by name | Debounced |
| Status Filter | Dropdown | Filters by cycle status (active, completed, upcoming) | Single select |
| New Cycle Button | Button | Opens create cycle form/modal | Primary action |
| Active Cycle Banner | Card | Click navigates to active cycle detail | Prominent styling |
| Cycle Card | Card | Click navigates to cycle detail | Shows progress, members, dates |

## Data Display

Cycles are displayed in three sections:
1. **Active Cycle** — highlighted banner at top (if any)
2. **Past Cycles** — completed cycles, sorted by most recent
3. **Upcoming Cycles** — planned cycles, sorted by start date

Each cycle card shows:
- Cycle name
- Status indicator (active/completed/upcoming)
- Date range
- Progress bar (issues done / total)
- Member avatars

**Real-time list-level behaviour:**
- `cycle.created`: New cycle card inserts in appropriate section (upcoming) with highlight
- `cycle.activated`: A cycle moves from "Upcoming" to "Active" section with highlight animation
- `cycle.completed`: Active cycle moves to "Past" section, progress bar fills to completion
- `cycle.updated`: Card highlights briefly, fields update in place

## Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| Search Placeholder | Suggests search | "Search cycles..." |
| Active Cycle Label | Identifies current cycle | "Sprint 14 (Active)" |
| Progress Text | Shows completion | "8/12 issues done" |
| Date Range | Shows cycle duration | "Jan 15 – Jan 29" |
| Section Headers | Group cycles by status | "Past Cycles", "Upcoming Cycles" |
| Empty State | No cycles in team | "No cycles yet. Create your first cycle to start planning sprints." |

## States

### Populated (Default)

List shows active cycle banner, past cycles, and upcoming cycles.

```
(see Layout Regions sketch above)
```

### Updated (Real-time Event Received)

A real-time event activates or completes a cycle. The affected card highlights; cycle may move between sections.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [>Status ▼]                       [+ New Cycle]  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  ▶ Sprint 14 (Active)                  Jan 15 – Jan 29      | |
|  |  [==============================------] 80%   9/12 issues    | | ← UPDATED (highlighted)
|  |  👤 Sarah (lead)  👤 Mike  👤 Emily                           | |    (progress updated)
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
|  --- Past Cycles ---                                               |
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  ✓ Sprint 13                          Jan 1 – Jan 14        | |
|  |  [==============================--] 90%   11/12 issues done  | |
|  |  Completed Jan 14                                           | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (real-time event: cycle.updated — active cycle progress updates, card highlights)
```

### Cycle Activated (Real-time Event)

A cycle moves from "Upcoming" to "Active" — banner appears, old active moves to past.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  ▶ Sprint 15 (Active)                  Jan 30 – Feb 12      | | ← NEW ACTIVE (highlighted, inserted as banner)
|  |  [----] 0%   0/15 issues                                     | |
|  |  👤 Sarah (lead)                                              | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
|  --- Past Cycles ---                                               |
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  ✓ Sprint 14                          Jan 15 – Jan 29       | | ← MOVED to past
|  |  [==============================--] 90%   11/12 issues done  | |
|  |  Completed Jan 29                                            | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
  (real-time event: cycle.activated — new cycle becomes active,
   previous active moves to past section)
```

### Loading (Initial Load or Reconnect)

Skeleton mirrors the populated layout — skeleton banner + skeleton cards.

```
