|  |  [===========----]                 [== skeleton ====]        | |
|  |  [👤][👤]                                                   | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
|  --- Past Cycles ---                                               |
|                                                                    |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  [==== skeleton ====]              [========= skeleton ====] | |
|  |  [===========----]                 [== skeleton ====]        | |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Empty (No Cycles)

Full-width empty state with guide-to-action.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [🔍 Search___]  [>Status ▼]                       [+ New Cycle]  |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|                     [Icon Illustration]                           |
|                     No cycles yet                                  |
|                     Create your first cycle to start planning     |
|                     sprints.                                      |
|                     [+ Create Cycle]                               |
|                                                                    |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

## Responsive

| Breakpoint | Changes |
|------------|---------|
| Desktop (>1024px) | Full layout, active banner prominent, sections visible |
| Tablet (768-1024px) | Same layout, slightly compact |
| Mobile (<768px) | Single column, active banner full width, section headers collapsible, "New Cycle" becomes FAB |

## Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | `main` landmark contains cycle list; active banner is a `section` with aria-label |
| Heading order | h1: "Cycles" (page title, implied), h2: "Past Cycles", "Upcoming Cycles" |
| Reading / Focus order | Top to bottom: Toolbar → Active Cycle Banner → Past Cycles → Upcoming Cycles |
| Accessible names | Search: aria-label="Search cycles", New Cycle: aria-label="Create new cycle", Active banner: aria-label="Active cycle: {name}" |
| Keyboard operability | Tab through toolbar, banner, and cycle cards; Enter/Space opens cycle detail |
| Target size | ≥24×24 CSS px on toolbar controls and cycle cards |
| Focus not obscured | Toolbar is not sticky |
| Non-color intent | Status icon + label text, progress bar + percentage text |

## Assumptions

- **Existing screen**: This is an existing list view receiving real-time updates. The wireframe focuses on real-time-specific behaviour (section transitions on activate/complete, highlight animations).
- **Cycle sections**: The three-section layout (Active/Past/Upcoming) is the existing screen structure. Real-time events cause items to move between sections.
- **Active cycle**: Only one cycle can be active at a time. The `cycle.activated` event moves a cycle from Upcoming to Active and the previous Active to Past.
